{"id":1030401,"chapter_id":1030401,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"█编号：FAC-M-136-Ⅰ\n█档案：禁闭者抓捕行动档案","style":10,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"MBCC追踪小队于“疯剪子传说”新增地抓捕一名禁闭者。对象落网时意识不清，推测为在逃罪人阿黛拉。\n狂厄级禁闭者阿黛拉，斯洛恩街雾巷袭击案嫌疑人。虽无影像资料证实，但推测其能力可以干涉他人意识，极度危险，应立即收容。","style":10,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"*附录——监察记录：\n对象已被成功收押。急需MBCC局长进行审查，加强监管，彻底阻止其危险行为。","style":10,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"阿黛拉端坐在审查室的另一侧，笑着看你走进房间。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401004,"trial_step":4,"drawing":1030400},{"step":5,"content":"笑容温和，身材纤细，看起来毫无威胁——但你知道，事实恰巧相反。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401005,"trial_step":5,"drawing":1030400},{"step":6,"options":["让我们开始吧。"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401006,"trial_step":6,"course":3,"drawing":1030400,"choices":[{"text":"让我们开始吧。","goto":7}]},{"step":7,"content":"你在阿黛拉正对面坐好，放下监察报告与证物——在这个过程中，阿黛拉的视线从未离开过你的脸。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401008,"trial_step":8,"drawing":1030400},{"step":8,"options":["你在看什么？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401009,"trial_step":9,"course":3,"drawing":1030400},{"step":9,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"嗯？没什么。只是觉得，我好像在哪见过你。","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401010,"trial_step":10,"drawing":1030402},{"step":10,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"你的脸看起来很眼熟，但我没法在记忆中找到对应的片段……我们之前见过吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401011,"trial_step":11,"drawing":1030400},{"step":11,"options":["没有","或许在斯洛恩街见过"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401012,"trial_step":12,"course":3,"drawing":1030400,"choices":[{"text":"没有","goto":13},{"text":"或许在斯洛恩街见过","goto":16}]},{"step":12,"content":"你也没有和这位禁闭者交流的记忆。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401013,"trial_step":13,"drawing":1030400},{"step":13,"content":"这大概是我们的第一次见面，“疯剪子”小姐。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401014,"trial_step":14,"drawing":1030400},{"step":14,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"……这样啊，那可能是我的错觉吧，请不要放在心上。","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401015,"trial_step":15,"drawing":1030401,"next":[19]},{"step":15,"content":"你并没有和这位禁闭者交流的记忆，但……","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401016,"trial_step":16,"drawing":1030402},{"step":16,"content":"我不记得，但或许我们曾在斯洛恩街的大雾袭击案中见过，“疯剪子”小姐。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401017,"trial_step":17,"drawing":1030402},{"step":17,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"斯洛恩街？又是一个陌生的地方呢。","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401018,"trial_step":18,"drawing":1030402},{"step":18,"content":"阿黛拉的情绪非常平稳，并没有因你的试探而产生波动。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401019,"trial_step":19,"drawing":1030402},{"step":19,"content":"——一个看似清醒却行事疯狂的危险分子。她默认了自己的身份。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401020,"trial_step":20,"drawing":1030402},{"step":20,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"局长应该不会无故叫我过来，有什么我能帮到你的呢？","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401021,"trial_step":21,"drawing":1030401},{"step":21,"content":"你想问的很多，关于疯剪子，关于雾巷袭击案。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401022,"trial_step":22,"drawing":1030400},{"step":22,"content":"雾巷袭击案并未留下现场影像资料，而在场全员几乎都被禁闭者的强大能力影响，无法回忆起凶嫌的样貌。追踪小队只能凭借都市传说继续调查，最终抓捕能力失控的阿黛拉。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401023,"trial_step":23,"drawing":1030400},{"step":23,"content":"但现在，比起疯剪子传说，当下你还有个更棘手的麻烦——","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401024,"trial_step":24,"drawing":1030400},{"step":24,"options":["打开监察报告"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401025,"trial_step":25,"course":3,"drawing":1030400,"choices":[{"text":"打开监察报告","goto":26}]},{"step":25,"content":"狂厄级禁闭者阿黛拉，几日间共计袭击MBCC工作人员及禁闭者11名，造成精神伤害患者约10名……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401026,"trial_step":26,"drawing":1030400},{"step":26,"speaker":"旁白","content":"你用余光看了一眼阿黛拉。她的笑容温柔亲切，既不像都市传说中的疯狂剪刀手，也不像监察报告中提到的危险禁闭者。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401027,"trial_step":27,"drawing":1030400},{"step":27,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"你的脸色看起来不太好，他们对你很重要？你在担心他们吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401028,"trial_step":28,"drawing":1030400},{"step":28,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"放心，只是一点微弱的影响，小睡一会儿，他们很快就能恢复清醒。","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401029,"trial_step":29,"drawing":1030400},{"step":29,"options":["这和你无关","我要问的不是这件事"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401030,"trial_step":30,"course":3,"drawing":1030400,"choices":[{"text":"这和你无关","goto":31},{"text":"我要问的不是这件事","goto":null}]},{"step":30,"content":"MBCC的工作有危险，这里每个人都有直面狂厄的心理准备。比起担心，我会在一开始就保护他们不受伤。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401031,"trial_step":31,"drawing":1030400},{"step":31,"content":"至于袭击他们的你……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401032,"trial_step":32,"drawing":1030400},{"step":32,"content":"你不是为了越狱。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401033,"trial_step":33,"drawing":1030400},{"step":33,"content":"想要逃出MBCC的禁闭者不少，但阿黛拉和他们不一样。她并没有逃离现场，反而将那些精神受创的被袭者送回了休息区。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401034,"trial_step":34,"drawing":1030400},{"step":34,"content":"你到底在谋划什么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401035,"trial_step":35,"drawing":1030400},{"step":35,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"谋划？不，我只是想帮帮他们。","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401036,"trial_step":36,"drawing":1030403},{"step":36,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"发丝将他们层层缠绕包裹……他们不得不背着那些头发到处奔波。","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401037,"trial_step":37,"drawing":1030403},{"step":37,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"我原本不想惊动你们，但也不忍心看着大家那么受累……所以想着，干脆帮他们剪下来吧。没想到还是给你们添麻烦了。","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401038,"trial_step":38,"drawing":1030403},{"step":38,"content":"阿黛拉叹了口气。她讲得很真诚，但理由却诡异到离谱。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1030403},{"step":39,"options":["发丝？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401040,"trial_step":40,"course":3,"drawing":1030403,"choices":[{"text":"发丝？","goto":41}]},{"step":40,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"抱歉，忘了向您解释。","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401041,"trial_step":41,"drawing":1030402},{"step":41,"content":"阿黛拉撩开额前垂落的发丝，保持着微笑望向你。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401042,"trial_step":42,"drawing":1030400},{"step":42,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"纠缠不清的牵绊，无法抛却的烦心事……那些东西会化作疯狂生长的发丝，越来越多，越缠越紧……","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401043,"trial_step":43,"drawing":1030400},{"step":43,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"我所做的，不过是帮助他们摆脱负担。","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401044,"trial_step":44,"drawing":1030404},{"step":44,"content":"我还是不明白你在说什么。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1030404},{"step":45,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"或许只有拿起剪刀的人才能看到那副景象，不过……","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1030404},{"step":46,"content":"阿黛拉依旧看着你，只不过笑容不知不觉间消失了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401047,"trial_step":47,"drawing":1030405},{"step":47,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"只不过，我曾经犯过一些错误，给大家添了很多麻烦。我不能再重蹈覆辙了。","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401048,"trial_step":48,"drawing":1030405},{"step":48,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"从始至终，帮大家剪断烦恼都是我的责任，也只能是我的责任。","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401049,"trial_step":49,"drawing":1030405},{"step":49,"content":"你还是无法完全理解这番话的含义。但你从这些琐碎而含糊的话中找到了最关键的信息——","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401050,"trial_step":50,"drawing":1030405},{"step":50,"content":"“剪断烦恼”，是吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401051,"trial_step":51,"drawing":1030405},{"step":51,"content":"所以，你在迷雾中袭击斯洛恩街的居民，也是为了“剪断”他们的烦恼吗?","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401052,"trial_step":52,"drawing":1030405},{"step":52,"options":["拿出斯洛恩街居民报告"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401053,"trial_step":53,"course":3,"drawing":1030405,"choices":[{"text":"拿出斯洛恩街居民报告","goto":54}]},{"step":53,"content":"调查显示，斯洛恩街的居民普遍出现了“记忆丧失”的问题，这与MBCC的遇袭员工状况一致。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1030405},{"step":54,"content":"事到如今，你还想说你是无辜的吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401055,"trial_step":55,"drawing":1030405},{"step":55,"content":"你紧盯着阿黛拉的眼睛，试图从那里找到任何动摇的情绪。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401056,"trial_step":56,"drawing":1030405},{"step":56,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"我的确不知道您在说什么。我从来没有去过斯洛恩街，对那里也没有任何了解。","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401057,"trial_step":57,"drawing":1030400},{"step":57,"content":"你已经审查过许多禁闭者，相信再细微的情绪也很难逃过你的眼睛。可你看到的，却只有一双真诚的眼睛。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1030400},{"step":58,"content":"面前的女人是个说谎的天才？又或者她经历过超常的心理训练？","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401059,"trial_step":59,"drawing":1030400},{"step":59,"content":"你找不到头绪，只能寄托于寻找一些另外的线索。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401060,"trial_step":60,"drawing":1030400},{"step":60,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":61,"course":6,"drawing":1030400},{"step":61,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":61,"course":6,"drawing":1030400},{"step":62,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置3","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":61,"course":6,"drawing":1030400},{"step":63,"options":["选择1"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":61,"course":6,"drawing":1030400},{"step":64,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置4","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":61,"course":6,"drawing":1030400},{"step":65,"options":["选择1","选择2"],"jump":[7,9],"style":4,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":61,"course":6,"drawing":1030400},{"step":66,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":61,"course":6,"drawing":1030400},{"step":67,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":61,"course":6,"drawing":1030400},{"step":68,"content":"你让工作人员带来了重要物证——阿黛拉的行李箱。随着阿黛拉在行动中被捕，这个精致的箱子也被带到了管理局。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401062,"trial_step":62,"drawing":1030400},{"step":69,"content":"行李箱上的锁仍完好无损，并未被强制撬开。阿黛拉笑着说道：","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401063,"trial_step":63,"drawing":1030401},{"step":70,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"您的确是位得体的绅士。","female_content":"您的确是位得体的淑女。","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_18","vo_trial_30401_1_18f"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401064,"trial_step":64,"drawing":1030401},{"step":71,"content":"其实只是事出突然，这个行李箱还没有被搜查过。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401065,"trial_step":65,"drawing":1030401},{"step":72,"content":"那么，我现在可以打开它吗，阿黛拉小姐？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401066,"trial_step":66,"drawing":1030401},{"step":73,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"恐怕我也没有拒绝的资格吧？","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401067,"trial_step":67,"drawing":1030400},{"step":74,"content":"阿黛拉微笑着抬抬手。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401068,"trial_step":68,"drawing":1030400},{"step":75,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"请便。","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401069,"trial_step":69,"drawing":1030400},{"step":76,"content":"你打开行李箱。在一阵淡淡的薰衣草香气萦绕下，衣物、洗漱用品、票据被井然有序地分类安放。看得出来，箱子的主人是一位很善于规划旅行的细心女士。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401070,"trial_step":70,"drawing":1030400},{"step":77,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"如您所见，这里面并没有什么特别的东西。","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401071,"trial_step":71,"drawing":1030400},{"step":78,"content":"衣物和洗漱用品固然不能提供有效信息，但那些票据却引起了你的注意。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401072,"trial_step":72,"drawing":1030400},{"step":79,"options":["取出存放的票据"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401073,"trial_step":73,"course":3,"drawing":1030400,"choices":[{"text":"取出存放的票据","goto":74}]},{"step":80,"content":"阿索比镇的理发店开业证明、林荫商业区的家具采购收据，以及斯洛恩街的房屋租赁合同……","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401074,"trial_step":74,"drawing":1030400},{"step":81,"content":"这些纸质文件或新或旧，都被整齐地叠放在行李箱的夹层中。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401075,"trial_step":75,"drawing":1030400},{"step":82,"content":"你有什么想说的吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401076,"trial_step":76,"drawing":1030400},{"step":83,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"这些票据吗？我确实有保存收据的习惯，总觉得这些小票或许能在哪派上用场，还是留下为好。","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401077,"trial_step":77,"drawing":1030400},{"step":84,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"可惜，事实证明，它们只会占用行李箱的空间，而我一直没想起来丢掉……不知不觉间，已经攒下这么多了。","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401078,"trial_step":78,"drawing":1030402},{"step":85,"options":["我并不是想询问你的爱好。"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401079,"trial_step":79,"course":3,"drawing":1030402,"choices":[{"text":"我并不是想询问你的爱好。","goto":80}]},{"step":86,"content":"阿索比镇、林荫商业区，还有我们刚刚提到过的斯洛恩街……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401080,"trial_step":80,"drawing":1030402},{"step":87,"content":"这些地方无一例外，都曾经流传过关于“疯剪子”的传说。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401081,"trial_step":81,"drawing":1030402},{"step":88,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"哦，是吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401082,"trial_step":82,"drawing":1030400},{"step":89,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"您刚刚提到的地名，我都没有什么印象了。","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401083,"trial_step":83,"drawing":1030400},{"step":90,"content":"你真的不记得？狄斯城恐怕找不到第二个拥有你这种能力的禁闭者了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401084,"trial_step":84,"drawing":1030400},{"step":91,"content":"阿黛拉的表情很轻松。你遇到过不少所谓的骗术大师，他们也并不能做到长时间的一点不露破绽。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401085,"trial_step":85,"drawing":1030400},{"step":92,"content":"现有的证据已经给出了答案，她不可能不记得，除非……","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401086,"trial_step":86,"drawing":1030400},{"step":93,"options":["你把自己的记忆也消除了？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401087,"trial_step":87,"course":3,"drawing":1030400,"choices":[{"text":"你把自己的记忆也消除了？","goto":88}]},{"step":94,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"……所有人都会因烦恼生出长发，我当然也不例外。","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401088,"trial_step":88,"drawing":1030400},{"step":95,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"或许我真的去过那些地方，又或许，我剪断了大家的愁绪，包括我自己的……谁知道呢？","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401089,"trial_step":89,"drawing":1030400},{"step":96,"content":"阿黛拉的脸上依旧是那副平静温和的神色，但你却莫名觉得有些不安。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401090,"trial_step":90,"drawing":1030400},{"step":97,"content":"这说不通……你这样做的理由是什么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401091,"trial_step":91,"drawing":1030400},{"step":98,"content":"听到你的问题，阿黛拉笑了笑，耐心解释道：","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401092,"trial_step":92,"drawing":1030404},{"step":99,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"无论身处何处，我所做的不过是倾听烦恼、剪断忧愁，给予亲爱的顾客们平静安逸的生活。","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401093,"trial_step":93,"drawing":1030404},{"step":100,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"当烦恼被剪断，过去的一切不再是负担，剩下的唯一困扰，或许就只有那个伴随着“疯剪子”传说而来的理发师了吧。","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401094,"trial_step":94,"drawing":1030404},{"step":101,"options":["可这样你又给自己留下了什么？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401095,"trial_step":95,"course":3,"drawing":1030404,"choices":[{"text":"可这样你又给自己留下了什么？","goto":96}]},{"step":102,"content":"阿黛拉闭上眼睛，片刻之后，给出了答复。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401096,"trial_step":96,"drawing":1030402},{"step":103,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"……平静。","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401097,"trial_step":97,"drawing":1030400},{"step":104,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"我给自己留下了平静的，无所牵绊的生活。","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401098,"trial_step":98,"drawing":1030400},{"step":105,"content":"这太荒谬了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401099,"trial_step":99,"drawing":1030400},{"step":106,"content":"难道你过去的每一段生活，最终留给你的都只有烦恼和忧愁而已吗？就只有将所有人的记忆都消除这一种方法吗？！","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401100,"trial_step":100,"drawing":1030400},{"step":107,"content":"面对你的不解和愤怒，阿黛拉没有表现出对抗。相反，她的身体微微前倾，脸上露出的表情，分明是担忧与关切。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401101,"trial_step":101,"drawing":1030403},{"step":108,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"抱歉，您看上去很烦恼，是我的缘故吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401102,"trial_step":102,"drawing":1030403},{"step":109,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"……需要我，帮您吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401103,"trial_step":103,"drawing":1030403},{"step":110,"content":"阿黛拉的一番关切令你如坠冰窟。极度的危机感一瞬间浇灭了你刚刚所有的情绪。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401104,"trial_step":104,"drawing":1030403},{"step":111,"content":"你下意识地回答了她。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401105,"trial_step":105,"drawing":1030403},{"step":112,"options":["不需要。"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401106,"trial_step":106,"course":3,"drawing":1030403,"choices":[{"text":"不需要。","goto":107}]},{"step":113,"content":"我不需要你对我使用那种能力，更不想“忘记”这些烦恼。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401107,"trial_step":107,"drawing":1030403},{"step":114,"speaker":"阿黛拉","content":"是吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30401_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_adela_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401108,"trial_step":108,"drawing":1030400},{"step":115,"content":"阿黛拉有些可惜地笑着。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130401109,"